  "id": "movement-perspective",
  "term": "movement perspective",
  "definition": "In temporal thinking, a movement perspective is the viewpoint used to imagine motion between oneself and time. It can take the form of seeing oneself as moving forward through time or seeing time as moving toward oneself.",
